}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # List User HKI
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/hki`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil daftar HKI",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "judul": "Aplikasi AI untuk Pertanian",
        "jenis_hki": "Hak Cipta",
        "sub_jenis_ciptaan": "Program Komputer",
        "nomor_permohonan": "P00202400001",
        "tanggal_permohonan": "2024-01-15",
        "status_hki": "Dalam Proses",
        "inventor": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi",
        "pemegang_hak": "Universitas Indonesia",
        "deskripsi": "Deskripsi HKI",
        "file_sertifikat": "/uploads/proposals/sertifikat.pdf",
        "file_dokumen_pendukung": "/uploads/proposals/dokumen.pdf",
        "status": "Pending",
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z",
        "user": {
          "id": "uuid",
          "name": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi",
          "email": "ahmad@univ.ac.id",
          "nidn": "1234567890",
          "institusi": "Universitas Indonesia",
          "prodi": "Teknik Informatika"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
